       Acu-Initial-Routine.
      *    Before-Init
      * get system information
           ACCEPT System-Information FROM System-Info
      * get terminal information
           ACCEPT Terminal-Abilities FROM Terminal-Info
      * open file
           PERFORM Acu-Open-Files
      *    After-Init
           .

       Acu-Exit-Rtn.
           PERFORM Acu-Close-Files
      *    After-Program
           EXIT PROGRAM
           STOP RUN
           .

       Acu-Open-Files.
      *    Before-Open
           PERFORM Acu-Open-Department
           PERFORM Acu-Open-Books
      *    After-Open
           .

       Acu-Open-Department.
      *    Before-Open
           OPEN OUTPUT Department 
           IF NOT Depart-status(1:1) = "0"
              PERFORM Acu-Extended-File-Status
              GO TO Acu-Exit-Rtn
           END-IF
      *    After-Open
           .

       Acu-Open-Books.
      *    Before-Open
           OPEN OUTPUT Books 
           IF NOT Books-status(1:1) = "0"
              PERFORM Acu-Extended-File-Status
              GO TO Acu-Exit-Rtn
           END-IF
      *    After-Open
           .

       Acu-CreateScr-Routine.
      *    Before-Routine
           PERFORM Acu-CreateScr-Scrn
           PERFORM Acu-CreateScr-Proc
      *    After-Routine
           .

       Acu-CreateScr-Scrn.
           PERFORM Acu-CreateScr-Create-Win
           PERFORM Acu-CreateScr-Init-Data
           .

       Acu-CreateScr-Create-Win.
      *    Before-Create
      * display screen
              DISPLAY Standard GRAPHICAL WINDOW
                 LINES 16.00, SIZE 38.00, CELL HEIGHT 10, 
                 CELL WIDTH 10, AUTO-MINIMIZE, COLOR IS 65793, 
                 LABEL-OFFSET 0, LINK TO THREAD, MODELESS, NO SCROLL, 
                 WITH SYSTEM MENU, 
                 TITLE "Screen", TITLE-BAR, NO WRAP, 
                 EVENT PROCEDURE Create-Event-Proc, 
                 HANDLE IS Create-Handle
      * toolbar
           DISPLAY CreateScr UPON Create-Handle
      *    After-Create
           .

       Acu-CreateScr-Init-Data.
      *    Before-Initdata
      *    After-Initdata
           .
      * CreateScr
       Acu-CreateScr-Proc.
           PERFORM UNTIL Exit-Pushed
              ACCEPT CreateScr  
                 ON EXCEPTION PERFORM Acu-CreateScr-Evaluate-Func
              END-ACCEPT
           END-PERFORM
           DESTROY Create-Handle
           INITIALIZE Key-Status
           .

      * CreateScr
       Acu-CreateScr-Evaluate-Func.
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN Exit-Pushed
                 PERFORM Acu-CreateScr-Exit
              WHEN Event-Occurred
                 IF Event-Type = Cmd-Close
                    PERFORM Acu-CreateScr-Exit
                 END-IF
      * Create-Pb-1 Link To
              WHEN Key-Status = 7
                 PERFORM Create-Pb-1-Link
           END-EVALUATE
           MOVE 1 TO Accept-Control
           .

       Acu-Close-Files.
      *    Before-Close
           CLOSE Department
           CLOSE Books
      *    After-Close
           .

      * Department

       Acu-Department-Rec-Write.
           WRITE Departme-rec
           .

       Acu-Department-Delete.
           DELETE FILE Department
           .

      * Books

       Acu-Books-Rec-Write.
           WRITE Books-rec
           .

       Acu-Books-Delete.
           DELETE FILE Books
           .

       Acu-CreateScr-Exit.
           SET Exit-Pushed TO TRUE
           .

